  "details": "Currently the Drone's Controller Settings when on Desktop has a setting for \"Mouse Mode\", with the two options; \"Relative\" and \"Continuous\".\n\nIt would be nice to have the option to disable mouse control completely.\n\nThis would be useful because the arrow keys can actually be used instead of the mouse. But then accidently bumping your mouse will make your drone spin out of control.\n\nAs an aside, maybe make it more clear that the arrow keys can actually be used? Instead of adding a \"Disabled\" option to the \"Mouse Mode\" setting, you could just add a \"Arrow Keys Only\" option instead to make it clear.",
